Server init.
>> a := Blob cusub: 4.
a bytes: ( Liis cusub ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob cusub: 4.
b bytes: ( Liis cusub ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a cusub.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Soo-saar qor: ['xorred:'], sadar-cusub. 
Soo-saar qor: n, sadar-cusub. 
} qabo: { :e Soo-saar qor: e, sadar-cusub. }, bilow.
a sii-daa.
b sii-daa.
